BearSSL 0.6 upstream source subset

Source archive: https://bearssl.org/bearssl-0.6.tar.gz
SHA-256: 6705bba1714961b41a728dfc5debbe348d2966c117649392f8c8139efc83ff14
Upstream project: https://bearssl.org/

The upstream `inc/`, `src/`, and `LICENSE.txt` are kept verbatim. BearSSL is
distributed under MIT; preserve its copyright/license notices in every source
file. This copy contains the library needed by the 32-bit web worker. It does
not include upstream command-line tools or test corpus.
